# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CI-REQUIRED ASSET EXCEPTIONS (CI/CD remediation, 2026-11-16)
# These assets are consumed by reality_gate.sh and the CI workflows. They were
# untracked in the working tree; make our intent to version them explicit. The
# root-level `dist/*` rule is root-relative, so nested dist/ trees were already
# not matched, but we restate the exceptions here so a future broad rule cannot
# silently drop them. Sensitive/binary patterns are re-asserted afterwards so we
# never version keys, DBs, secrets, caches, or large binaries by accident.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/**
!workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/dist/evidence-bundle.json
!workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/dist/cockpit.js
!workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/dist/cockpit.css
!workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/dist/index.html
!workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/dist/trust_root.js
!workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/dist/assets.lock.json
!workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/dist/known_good_sources.json
!core/ops/tools/xoras_file_writer.py
!core/ops/scripts/verify_sovereign_file_writer.sh
!core/ops/scripts/verify_cockpit.sh
!tests/test_xoras_file_writer.py
!tests/test_e2e_sovereign_gate.py
!.github/workflows/boundary_gate.yml

# Re-assert secret/DB/cache/binary ignores inside the re-included cockpit tree.
workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/**/__pycache__/
workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/**/*.pyc
workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/**/*.db
workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/**/*.key
workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/**/*.pem
workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/**/.env*
workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/**/*.bin
workspaces/telemetry_cockpit/**/*.onnx

